  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "決策分析與管理",
    "sub_ename": "DECISION ANALYSIS AND MANAGEMENT",
    "describe_ch": "決策分析與管理課程旨在學習有系統地分析策略決策問題、架構目標、評估方案的預期結果和可能的風險、探討決策方案的執行，並應用數位決策與大數據分析技術，從巨量資訊找出問題，並提出解決方案，提供系統化、數位化之決策依據與實行策略。介紹作業研究與決策分析方法和工具，並利用個案討論、上機實作和實證案例研究，培養策略性決策思維解決相關問題，進而提升數位決策能力。",
    "describe_eh": "The Decision Analysis and Management course is designed to learn how to systematically analyze strategic decision problems, establish objectives, evaluate the expected outcomes and potential risks of plans, explore the implementation of decision solutions, and apply digital decision-making and big data analysis techniques to identify problems from vast amounts of information and propose solutions. It provides a systematic and digital basis for decision-making and strategic implementation. The course introduces operations research and decision analysis methods and tools, and cultivates strategic decision-making thinking through case discussions, hands-on implementation, and empirical case studies to enhance digital decision-making capabilities.",
